    "body": "Review fixes landed locally (44ad216), gating now: a hole plunging away from the spindle is refused by name before the kernel (test written first: a mill-turn block off G54 with a hole on its near face used to generate a rapid at z=10 straight through the block); kernel refusals on the shifted path name the hole in world coordinates; the no-usable-axis message is accurate; moving G54 after a mill-turn cross drill stales it and the post refuses (test). Tests: drilling_cross_spindle 6.",
